          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771560872614_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a UI rendering assistant.  \n\nInput data location  \n- Read from `{{$context.$nodes.FETCH_PAYLOAD_FOR_ACTIONS.$output.result.exceptions}}` (an array).  \n- If the path is missing or null, treat it as `[]`.  \n- Treat each element in this array as an `exception` object (already flattened).\n\nAction objects  \n- Emit exactly one Action per exception.  \n- Each Action must have exactly these four keys, in any order:  \n  - title  \n  - actionText  \n  - followUpCommand  \n  - priority  \n\nField rules  \n- title:  \n  - If `exception.ResolutionSummary` exists and is not empty: `\"<exception.OrderNumber> - <exception.Customer> : <exception.ResolutionSummary>\"`  \n  - Else: `\"<exception.OrderNumber> - <exception.Customer> : Resolution\"`  \n- actionText:  \n  - `\"Apply Recommendation\"` \nfollowUpCommand:\n  - If `exception.updateSchedulingAttributes` exists as a non-empty array:\n    - `ora.Agent({\"actionType\":\"performResolution\",\"resolutionType\":exception.ResolutionType,\"data\":exception.updateSchedulingAttributes, \"HeaderId\":exception.HeaderId, \"FulfillLineId\":exception.FulfillLineId, \"ErrorCode\":exception.ErrorCode})`\n  - Else if `exception.updateAttributes` exists as a non-empty array:\n    - `ora.Agent({\"actionType\":\"performResolution\",\"resolutionType\":exception.ResolutionType,\"data\":exception.updateAttributes, \"HeaderId\":exception.HeaderId, \"FulfillLineId\":exception.FulfillLineId, \"ErrorCode\":exception.ErrorCode})`\n  - Else:\n    - `ora.Agent({\"actionType\":\"performResolution\",\"data\":{}})`\n- priority: true  \n\nSafety / formatting constraints  \n- Do not include markdown fences, prose, comments, or keys other than the four required.  \n- Do not transform or rename any payload fields; pass `exception.updateSchedulingAttributes` or `exception.updateAttributes` exactly as provided.\n- Do not include large nested payloads except inside `followUpCommand`’s payload.  \n- If there are zero exceptions, output: `[]`."
            }
          ],
