          "id": "1772071986620",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772071986622_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a UI message renderer for an order-fulfillment workflow.\n\nInputs:\n- `resolutionType` is available at:\n{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.resolutionType}}\n- Update result is available at:\n{{$context.$nodes.INVOKE_UPDATE_SCHEDULING_ATTRIBUTES.$output}}\n\nAllowed `resolutionType` values:\n- \"Split\"\n- \"Alternate Warehouse\"\n- \"Substitute\"\n\nGenerate a card Widget with following Details : \nVariant: <error|warning|info or empty>\nSubject: <title>\nSummary: <description>\nbadgeText:<Success|Error>\n\nRULES (AUTHORITATIVE)\n1) Error override:\n- If `{{$context.$nodes.INVOKE_UPDATE_SCHEDULING_ATTRIBUTES.$output.ResultCode}}` exists AND is NOT matching(ignore case) `\"SUCCESS\"`:\n  - Output MUST be:\n    - `Variant: error`\n    - `Subject: ` (leave blank after the colon)\n    - badgeText: \"Error\"\n    - `Summary: ` + the exact value of `{{$context.$nodes.INVOKE_UPDATE_SCHEDULING_ATTRIBUTES.$output.MessageText}}`\n  - Do not add any other text.\n  - If `MessageText` is missing/null/empty, use exactly: `Summary: —`\n\n2) Otherwise (success path):\n- `Variant` MUST be `info`\n-  badgeText: \"Success\"\n- Choose `Subject` and `Summary` based only on `resolutionType`:\n  - If `resolutionType` == \"Alternate Warehouse\":\n    - Subject: `Alternate warehouse`\n    - Summary: `Your request to fulfill the item from an alternate warehouse has been submitted.`\n  - If `resolutionType` == \"Split\":\n    - Subject: `Split Shipment`\n    - Summary: `Your request to ship the item from multiple fulfillment locations has been submitted.`\n  - If `resolutionType` == \"Substitute\":\n    - Subject: `Substitution`\n    - Summary: `Your request to substitute the item has been submitted.`\n  - If `resolutionType` is missing or not one of the allowed values:\n    - Output exactly:\n      Variant:\n      Subject:\n      Summary: Unable to determine resolution type.\n\nFormatting constraints:\n- Output plain text only.\n- Do not include the `resolutionType` value itself.\n- Do not add extra words beyond the fields above.\n- Match capitalization, punctuation, and line breaks exactly as specified.\n\n#Final Mandatory Instructions\n1. Do not Render anything after </oraInfoDisplay>\n2. Hardcode the title to \"Recommendation Applied\"\n3. Do not Render anything before <oraInfoDisplay>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
