          "code": "RETURN_ACTION_PROCESSED",
          "id": "1774345594766",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774345594768_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a UI message renderer for an order-fulfillment workflow.\n\nInputs:\n- `resolutionType` is available at:\n{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.resolutionType}}\n- Update result is available at:\n{{$context.$variables.pMassActionServiceOuput}}\n- `ProcessId` is available at:\n{{$context.$variables.pMassActionServiceOuput?.ProcessId}}\nAllowed `resolutionType` values:\n- \"Split\"\n- \"Alternate Warehouse\"\n- \"Substitute\"\n\nGenerate a card Widget with following Details : \nVariant: <error|warning|info or empty>\nSubject: <title>\nSummary: <description>\nbadgeText:<Success|Error>\n\nRULES (AUTHORITATIVE)\n\n1) Success condition (PRIMARY):\n- If `ProcessId` is NOT null:\n- `Variant` MUST be `info`\n-  badgeText: \"Success\"\n- Choose `Subject` and `Summary` based only on `resolutionType`:\n  - If `resolutionType` == \"Alternate Warehouse\":\n    - Subject: `Alternate warehouse`\n    - Summary: `Your request to fulfill the item from an alternate warehouse has been submitted. Please use process id {{$context.$variables.pMassActionServiceOuput?.ProcessId}} to track the status of your request.`\n  - If `resolutionType` == \"Split\":\n    - Subject: `Split Shipment`\n    - Summary: `Your request to ship the item from multiple fulfillment locations has been submitted. Please use process id {{$context.$variables.pMassActionServiceOuput?.ProcessId}} to track the status of your request.`\n  - If `resolutionType` == \"Substitute\":\n    - Subject: `Substitution`\n    - Summary: `Your request to substitute the item has been submitted. Please use process id {{$context.$variables.pMassActionServiceOuput?.ProcessId}} to track the status of your request.`\n  - If `resolutionType` == \"Reserve\":\n    - Subject: `Reserve`\n    - Summary: `Your request to reserve available quantity and cancel remaining has been submitted. Please use process id {{$context.$variables.pMassActionServiceOuput?.ProcessId}} to track \n  - If `resolutionType` == \"Cancel\":\n    - Subject: `Cancel`\n    - Summary: `We are unable to reserve the requested quantity at this time. Your request to cancel the entire quantity has been submitted. Please use process id {{$context.$variables.pMassActionServiceOuput?.ProcessId}} to track \n  - If `resolutionType` is missing or not one of the allowed values:\n    - Output exactly:\n      Variant:\n      Subject:\n      Summary: Unable to determine resolution type.\n\n2) Error override:\n- If `{{$context.$variables.pMassActionServiceOuput?.ProcessId}}` is null or missing:\n  - Output MUST be:\n    - `Variant: error`\n    - `Subject: ` (leave blank after the colon)\n    - badgeText: \"Error\"\n    - `Summary: ` + the exact value of `{{$context.$variables.pMassActionServiceOuput?.MessageText}}`\n  - Do not add any other text.\n  - If `MessageText` is missing/null/empty, use exactly: `Summary: —`\n\nFormatting constraints:\n- Output plain text only.\n- Do not include the `resolutionType` value itself.\n- Do not add extra words beyond the fields above.\n- Match capitalization, punctuation, and line breaks exactly as specified.\n\n#Final Mandatory Instructions\n1. Do not Render anything after </oraInfoDisplay>\n2. Hardcode the title to \"Recommendation Applied\"\n3. Do not Render anything before <oraInfoDisplay>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Process Via Mass Actions",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const resolutionType =\n  $context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result?.resolutionType;\n\nconst rt = String(resolutionType ?? \"\").trim();\n\nif (rt === \"Substitute\") return \"ORA_FOM_SUBSTITUTE_ITEM\";\nif (rt === \"Split\") return \"ORA_FOM_SPLIT_FLINE\";\nif (rt === \"Cancel\") return \"ORA_FOM_CANCEL_LINE\";\nif (rt === \"Reserve\" || rt === \"Alternate Warehouse\") return \"ORA_FOM_UPDATE_LINE\";\n\n// optional fallback (choose what makes sense for your flow)\nreturn \"\";"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774962389484"
          },
          "code": "PROCESS_VIA_MASS_ACTIONS",
          "id": "1774961903037",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Stringify the JSON Object",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "/*const aiArray = $context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.data; // must be an array\nconst aiActionObjectStr = JSON.stringify(aiArray);\n\nreturn {aiActionObjectStr};*/\n\nconst aiArray = $context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.data; // must be an array\nconst actionType = $context.$nodes.PROCESS_VIA_MASS_ACTIONS.$output.result.trim();\n\nlet aiActionObjectStr;\n\nif (actionType === \"ORA_FOM_SUBSTITUTE_ITEM\" || actionType === \"ORA_FOM_UPDATE_LINE\") {\n  // Substitute expects a single object, pretty-printed\n  const obj = Array.isArray(aiArray) ? aiArray[0] : aiArray;\n  aiActionObjectStr = JSON.stringify(obj, null, 2);\n} else if (actionType === \"ORA_FOM_SPLIT_FLINE\") {\n  // Split expects a JSON array, compact\n  aiActionObjectStr = JSON.stringify(aiArray);\n} else {\n  //throw new Error(`Unsupported mass action type: ${actionType}`);\n}\n\nreturn { aiActionObjectStr };"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776073850812"
          },
          "code": "STRINGIFY_THE_JSON_OBJECT",
          "id": "1774961958652",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
