              "id": "1774962163352_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your job is to create a valid JSON payload for the API call that is about to be made.\n\nInput:\n{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.data}}\n\nRequirement:\nThe output MUST be a single valid JSON object and nothing else.\n\nLogic:\n- If result.data is a JSON array (starts with '[' and ends with ']'), use it directly as the value of ScheduleLines.\n- If result.data is a JSON object (starts with '{' and ends with '}'), wrap it in an array and use that as the value of ScheduleLines.\n- Do not double-wrap arrays.\n\nOutput format:\n{\n  \"ScheduleLines\": <result.data as an array>\n}\n\nStrict rules:\n- Output ONLY the JSON payload (no commentary, no markdown, no code fences).\n- Ensure the JSON is valid (proper commas/quotes, no trailing commas)."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
